---
import sinKulupuImage  from "@/assets/sitelen/resources/sin-kulupu.svg"
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
---


<style>
		.sin-kulupu{
			display: grid;
			padding-inline: 1em;
			margin-block-start: -1em;
		}
		.skimg{
			width: 100%;
			height: auto;
			max-width: 16em;
			margin: 0 auto;
			display: inline;
			filter: contrast(400%);


		}
		h3 {
			margin-top: 2em;
			display: block;
		}
		h3 div{ 
			margin-block-start: -1em;

		}

</style>

	<h3><a href="https://sin-kulupu.pona.la/"><img alt="" class="skimg" src={sinKulupuImage.src} /></a> <div>NEWSLETTER</div></h3>

		<div class="sin-kulupu">
				<p>With Toki Pona content posted all over the place, how does anyone keep track of it all? The link-focused newsletter, <strong>sin kulupu</strong>, regularly collects new Toki Pona content from around the web and sends it directly to your inbox.
				<strong>Visit the <a href="https://sin-kulupu.pona.la/">sin kulupu website</a> to browse past newsletters</strong>, each a treasure trove of  Toki Pona content.</p>
		</div>
